{"id":"teppich","lemma":"Teppich","pos":"noun","rank":2545,"glosses":["rug, carpet (cloth covering for a floor)","tapestry (cloth hung on a wall)","slick (covering of oil)"],"ipa":"/ˈtɛpɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b6/De-Teppich.ogg/De-Teppich.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Teppiches","plural":"Teppiche"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich hasse diesen Teppich.","en":"I hate this rug.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/219295","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"hassen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"Wir wollen einen neuen Teppich.","en":"We want a new carpet.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},null]},{"text":"Dieser Teppich ist schön.","en":"This carpet is beautiful.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"well, beautifully"}]},{"text":"Antike Teppiche sind besonders wertvoll.","en":"Antique carpets are especially valuable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717791","words":[{"g":"of the age of Antiquity","l":"antik"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"especially"},{"g":"valuable"}]},{"text":"Ich werde einen neuen Teppich kaufen.","en":"I'm going to buy a new carpet.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},null,{"g":"to buy, to purchase"}]}]}